  "pli-tv-pvr16:24.6": "Sp 5.411: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Vatthuvipannaṁ hotīti akappiyadussaṁ hoti. Kālavipannaṁ nāma ajja dāyakehi dinnaṁ sve saṅgho kathinatthārakassa deti. Karaṇavipannaṁ nāma tadaheva chinditvā akataṁ</i>, “‘The object fails’: the cloth is unallowable. ‘The timing fails’: today it is given by the donors; tomorrow the Sangha gives to the one who is doing the robe-making ceremony. ‘The making fails’: they cut it, but do not finish it on the same day.” ",
  "pli-tv-pvr16:24.7": "",
