  "pli-tv-pvr16:26.1": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr16:26.2": "Sp 5.412: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Tesaññeva dhammānanti yesu rūpādidhammesu sati kathinaṁ nāma hoti, tesaṁ samodhānaṁ missībhāvo</i>, “‘Of just those things’: the combination and mixing together of those things, such as form, etc., by which there is the name <i lang='pi' translate='no'>kathina</i>.” Vmv 5.412: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Yesu rūpādidhammesūti “purimavassaṁvutthā bhikkhū, pañcahi anūno saṅgho, cīvaramāso, dhammena samena samuppannaṁ cīvara”nti evamādīsu yesu rūpārūpadhammesu</i>, “‘Of those things, such as form, etc.’: monks who have completed the first rains residence, a sangha of no less than five, the robe month, a robe that has arisen legitimately and validly, etc., are those things such as form, etc.” ",
  "pli-tv-pvr16:27.1": "",
